#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Bigfoot, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_ext_monsters_Bigfoot, race=AE_ext_monsters_monster
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Bigfoot.cfg:5
#: ./units/EE_units/monsters/Bigfoot.cfg:4
msgid "Bigfoot"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Bigfoot, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Terrible_Bigfoot, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Young_Bigfoot, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Bigfoot.cfg:18
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Terrible_Bigfoot.cfg:19
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Young_Bigfoot.cfg:18
msgid ""
"This unit is from BEEM. Its coding and art were done by Voodoo, Baro_st, "
"Tydeus, Dibs, and various others.\n"
"\n"
"There aren't many bigfoot in the world so it's difficult to see the few ones."
" Unbeatable masters in hiding among trees, these creatures can be 2mts tall "
"in the adultness and they are both among the mildest and the most powerful "
"warriors the forests have ever seen. Completely covered with a thick fur, "
"Bigfoot usually dislike fighting but for a good reason. However, they are "
"very protective of their territory and their kicks can easily floor also the "
"most resistant warriors. It's told Bigfoot can live a thousand year and the "
"older ones are so great and strong to uproot trees with extreme easiness."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Bigfoot.cfg:27
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Terrible_Bigfoot.cfg:47
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Young_Bigfoot.cfg:27
msgid "foot"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Carnivore_Plant, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Carnivore_Plant.cfg:5
msgid "Carnivore Plant"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Carnivore_Plant, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Fatal_Tangle, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Carnivore_Plant.cfg:18
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Fatal_Tangle.cfg:19
msgid ""
"This unit is from BEEM. Its coding and art were done by Voodoo, Baro_st, "
"Tydeus, Dibs, and various others.\n"
"\n"
"Also known as 'Terror of travelers', Carnivore Plants are indeed death "
"machines! As little plants or enormous bushes they only eat meat and their "
"teeth contain one of the most powerful poison of the world. Mingling "
"themselves in the forest, they can move using their roots that aren't fixed "
"in the ground as the ones of the common plants, but they are used as "
"tentacles! Despite their slowness, bigger Carnivore Plants can also throw "
"them grasping the enemies and slowing them while preparing the final hit."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Destroyer_Golem, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Destroyer_Golem.cfg:5
msgid "Destroyer Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Destroyer_Golem, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Golem_Wood_Defender, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_bem_wood_warriors_Little_Golem, race=AE_bem_wood_warriors_race
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Destroyer_Golem.cfg:20
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Golem_Wood_Defender.cfg:20
#: ./units/BEEM_units/wood_warriors/Little_Golem.cfg:20
msgid ""
"This unit is from BEEM. Its coding and art were done by Voodoo, Baro_st, "
"Tydeus, Dibs, and various others.\n"
" \n"
"Golems are huge monsters completely made of hard hock, therefore they are "
"immune to every type of poison. Able to live entire eras, these warriors are "
"practically indestructible. Their only weak point is their weakness to arcane"
" attacks due to the enchantment which gave them life from stones and which "
"can be broken only from another spell. The Golems move rolling on the ground "
"as enormous boulders thrown from a cliff. The incredible power of their "
"fists, with the ability to perfectly camouflage themselves among the rocks, "
"makes them one of the most feared warriors in the world. The bigger ones are "
"able to be lethal simply with the shock wave induced from the impact of their"
" fist on the ground."
msgstr ""

