#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_freemen_Aristocrat, race=AE_efm_freemen_race
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a1_Aristocrat.cfg:5
msgid "Aristocrat"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_freemen_Aristocrat, race=AE_efm_freemen_race
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a1_Aristocrat.cfg:17
msgid ""
"War is considered to be the foremost of aristocratic games and any born to "
"wealth who are not willing to participate are generally considered to not be "
"worthy of it. It is however, not the only game frequently played by the "
"aristocracy. Intrigue, blackmail, and assassination are all arts that get far"
" too much show even in times of peace."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=melee
#. [attack], type=blade, range=melee
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a1_Aristocrat.cfg:33
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a2_Amir.cfg:39
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a2_Vizier.cfg:41
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a3_Caliph.cfg:40
#: ./units/EFM_units/Freemen/a3_Sultan.cfg:42
