#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_imperialists_Legionnaire, race=AE_efm_imperialists_race
#. [unit_type], id=AE_myh_Legionnaire, race=AE_myh_celestial
#: ./units/EFM_units/Imperialists/a1_Legionnaire.cfg:5
#: ./units/EoM_units/celestials/b1_Legionnaire.cfg:5
msgid "Legionnaire"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_imperialists_Legionnaire, race=AE_efm_imperialists_race
#: ./units/EFM_units/Imperialists/a1_Legionnaire.cfg:17
msgid ""
"The imperialist legions are renowned throughout the world for their iron "
"discipline and ability to win through attrition. Though expensive to train "
"and arm without having great ability to damage their foes the legionnaire is "
"regarded as the core of the imperialist expansion effort. A formation of "
"these in an open field is very difficult to break."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_imperialists_Hoplite, race=AE_efm_imperialists_race
#: ./units/EFM_units/Imperialists/a2_Hoplite.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Sometimes the imperialist forces very up their tactics and use a wall of "
"spears rather than their traditional method of grinding. This limits their "
"mobility but any enemy will find this formation hard to break."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_efm_imperialists_Shock_Troop, race=AE_efm_imperialists_race
#: ./units/EFM_units/Imperialists/a2_ShockTroop.cfg:5
msgid "Shock Troop"
msgstr ""

