#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Fighter, race=AE_stf_free_saurians
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Fighter.cfg:5
msgid "Saurian Fighter"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Fighter, race=AE_stf_free_saurians
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Fighter.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Although not normally known for their abilities in close combat, with "
"experience they are formidable fighters. Those few veterans that survive long"
" enough in the saurians' internecine tribal wars are reknowned for their "
"fierceness in battle."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Frozen_Soul, race=undead
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Frozen_Soul.cfg:5
msgid "Frozen Soul"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Frozen_Soul, race=undead
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Frozen_Soul.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Frozen Souls are the souls of people and whatnot which are dreadfully forced "
"to serve their killers via the chilling, ethereal bindings which surround "
"them..."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=cold, range=ranged
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Frozen_Soul.cfg:22
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Ice_Heart.cfg:23
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Saurian_Elementalist.cfg:53
msgid "frigid aura"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Gladiator, race=AE_stf_free_saurians
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Gladiator.cfg:4
msgid "Saurian Gladiator"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Gladiator, race=AE_stf_free_saurians
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Gladiator.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Saurians are as a whole primitive savages, lacking both the technology and "
"the discipline to produce truly effective soldiers. Ocassionally however a "
"saurian is given equipment and training by more advanced races, often "
"captives taken from their tribe and groomed as contestants in blood sport or "
"as conscript soldiers. The combination of their superior agility with "
"advanced weaponry and combat technique makes them skilled and deadly "
"opponents; those that manage to rejoin their tribe are inevitably destined to"
" become great champions among their people."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Ice_Heart, race=undead
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Ice_Heart.cfg:5
msgid "Ice Heart"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Ice_Heart, race=undead
#: ./units/EOS_units/saurians/Ice_Heart.cfg:19
msgid ""
"After enslaving many other souls with its ethereal bindings Ice Souls turn "
"into more powerful creatures which are capable of producing more frigid "
"blasts and can fly further distances than before."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_stf_free_saurians_Assassin, race=AE_stf_free_saurians, gender=male
