#. [race], id=AE_mag_magical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/units.cfg:46
msgid ""
"Magical beings, often called abysmals, are entities made up mostly of pure "
"energy. They inhabit a different dimension called the Abyss - a place full of"
" primitive chaos, both creative and destructive in nature, where concepts "
"like space and time can be rather difficult to apply. Initially, their bodies"
" are shapeless clumps of energy due to the Abyss's nature, but once summoned "
"to the mortal world, they change their form to either become living "
"manifestations of elements, or become humanoid in appearance. The latter are "
"technically not-living, and thus do not age, are not susceptible to any "
"ailment, and damage to their bodies heals quite quickly."
msgstr ""

