#. [race], id=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/units.cfg:58
msgid ""
"The salamanders are a versatile and formidable race, skilled in both land and"
" aquatic combat. They possess a range of abilities and weapons, including "
"wrist blades, tridents, chakrams, nets, and maces. Their adaptive skin color "
"and knowledge of the swamps allow them to easily ambush their enemies, while "
"their ability to blend in with vegetation or change their skin color to match"
" their environment gives them an added advantage in stealth and deception. "
"Some salamanders specialize in aquatic ambushes, using their powerful jaws "
"and webbed feet to strike from the depths of the water. Others are masters of"
" desert combat, trained to fight in the scorching heat of the sun and armed "
"with wrist blades and throwing knives dipped in poison. A select few are even"
" rumored to have the power to control fire, making them feared and respected "
"allies in battle. Regardless of their individual strengths and weaknesses, "
"all salamanders share a deep connection to their natural environments and the"
" ancient magic that flows through them."
msgstr ""

