#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Blood_Warrior, race=orc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Blood_Warrior.cfg:149
msgid ""
"Blood Warriors are savage bloodthirsty orcs, driven by a singular purpose – "
"to slaughter everything in their path. These elite Barbarian berserkers from "
"the Barbarian faction charge into battle with no regard for their own safety,"
" relying on their rage and martial prowess to overcome almost any obstacle.\n"
"\n"
"Wielding twin gauntlet-mounted blades, they strike with lightning speed and "
"merciless efficiency, tearing through ranks of foes without hesitation. Their"
" eyes gleam with bloodlust, fueled by a never-ending thirst for violence; "
"once engaged, they become an unstoppable force of nature, relentless in their"
" pursuit of victory. \n"
"\n"
"Even after vanquishing an adversary, the Blood Warrior does not rest – he "
"continues to press forward, seeking fresh blood add to his already impressive"
" tally of kills."
msgstr ""

