#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Orcish_Warbanner.cfg:4
msgid "Orcish Warbanner"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Orcish_Warbanner, race=orc
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Orcish_Warrior, race=orc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Orcish_Warbanner.cfg:18
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Orcish_Warrior.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Savage and warlike Orcs form the back bone of the Barbarian hordes.\n"
"\n"
"Orc society is ill-suited to large-scale warfare, which leaves their small "
"tribes at prey to the more organized might of the world’s various armies. "
"However in the last two centuries something has changed. Orcs now fight with "
"Cyclops, Trolls, Rocs and goblins side by side whether it be in brutal "
"hunting packs or full blown armies. The origins of this change are unknown "
"but one thing is sure, when the barbarian hordes come screaming for your "
"blood the Orcs will be leading the charge."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Orcish_Warrior, race=orc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Orcish_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "Orcish Warrior"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Roc_Master, race=AE_mag_roc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Roc_Master.cfg:4
msgid "Roc Master"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Roc_Master, race=AE_mag_roc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Roc_Master.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Roc Masters are unrivaled aerial warriors among the Barbarian horde, boasting"
" decades of expertise in handling the majestic rocs. Having spent countless "
"hours training and bonding with these noble birds of prey, they have reached "
"the pinnacle of aerial combat prowess. With graceful ease, they pilot their "
"roc towards the battlefield, their sharp eyes scanning the horizon for "
"potential targets. As they swoop down, their mighty roc's claws effortlessly "
"rip enemies to shreds. The Roc Master himself wields a crossbow and a bolas, "
"for wounding or immobilizing foes safely from above. If you believe you are "
"safe from the Barbarians' wrath in the skies, you are sorely mistaken."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Roc_Tamer, race=AE_mag_roc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Roc_Tamer.cfg:4
msgid "Roc Tamer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Roc_Tamer, race=AE_mag_roc
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Roc_Tamer.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Veteran roc riders are an uncommon sight, as many either end up dying during "
"skirmishes or don't see much action beyond scouting, but there are noteworthy"
" exceptions. Such roc riders often end up being leaders of small roc rider "
"gangs, flying around empty territories and preying on the infrequent lone "
"travelers, and attacking poorly-guarded caravans. They also often bring "
"handmade bows with them into battle. While the bows' low quality makes them "
"nowhere near being fit for use on the ground, their arrows become quite "
"deadly when shot from the sky, thanks to the vertical acceleration from "
"falling."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Troll_Fire_Wizard, race=troll
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Troll_Fire_Wizard.cfg:4
msgid "Troll Fire Wizard"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Troll_Fire_Wizard, race=troll
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Troll_Fire_Wizard.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Troll shamans are the mystical leaders of the trolls. Though not as strong or"
" tough as other trolls, their true power lies in their fire magic, which they"
" use to blast enemies with gouts of fire."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Troll_Sorcerer, race=troll
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Troll_Sorcerer.cfg:4
msgid "Troll Sorcerer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Troll_Sorcerer, race=troll
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Barbarians/Troll_Sorcerer.cfg:17
msgid ""
"The Trolls within the Barbarian horde do not practice magic as it is known to"
" most races of the world although it easily could be confused for such. "
"Rather the rough skin of these mysterious creatures when brought into rapid "
"contact with itself can spark, igniting any flammable materials around them. "
"Thus with a snap of the fingers trolls can ignite the small bundles of straw "
"held within their palms before flinging them at the enemy. Such is the "
"preternatural aim of the Troll Sorcerers that no matter where the target is "
"hiding they will unerringly seek it out."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Troll_Warbanner, race=troll
