msgid "Black Salamander"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Black_Salamander, race=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Black_Salamander.cfg:17
msgid ""
"The Black Salamanders are assassins of sorts, attacking in the dead of night "
"or from the shadows. Besides wrist blades, they use throwing knives dipped in"
" poison. Those that survive the encounter, tell a tale of fighting off what "
"seemed to be a relentless red-eyed demon. Their skills, equipment, and "
"terror-inspiring appearance make Black Salamanders an opponent whose presence"
" should not be taken lightly."
msgstr ""

