#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Blue_Salamander, race=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Blue_Salamander.cfg:4
msgid "Blue Salamander"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Blue_Salamander, race=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Blue_Salamander.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Blue Salamanders are great at aquatic ambushes. They attack from the water "
"much like a crocodile. Those that are unwary and attempt to swim in the dark "
"swamps are heard never to come back. Blue salamanders wield tridents, along "
"with exotic throwing weapons called chakram, with which they are able to hit "
"far away enemies with deadly accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chaos_Wyvern, race=monster
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chaos_Wyvern.cfg:4
msgid "Chaos Wyvern"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chaos_Wyvern_Knight, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chaos_Wyvern_Knight.cfg:4
msgid "Chaos Wyvern Knight"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chosen_of_Forest, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Forest.cfg:4
msgid "Chosen of Forest"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chosen_of_Forest, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Forest.cfg:22
msgid ""
"The Chosen of Forest, or 'The Keeper', as many refer to him, is the "
"Darkblooded's monarch of sorts. He is the oldest and probably wisest of the "
"saurian mystics, knowing most of the jungle's secrets, including ones most "
"men would prefer not to know. While he does spend most of his time managing "
"state affairs, or meditating in the jungle, he's by no means incapable of "
"holding his own on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Forest.cfg:27
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Mystic.cfg:26
msgid "Summon Forest Spirit"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=cold, range=ranged
