#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chosen_of_Marsh, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Marsh.cfg:4
msgid "Chosen of Marsh"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chosen_of_Marsh, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Marsh.cfg:20
msgid ""
"The Chosen of Marsh are the mightiest of the Swamp Magi, fully consumed by "
"the Great Bog's darkness. They seem to emit clouds of magical poison gas "
"whenever they go, as potent as their venom-dipped claws. These vessels of "
"darkness are dreaded across the Jungle of Life, only ever referred to as "
"'those who must not be mentioned'. While the cult is not exactly in best "
"relations with the Darkblooded mystics, they did help the latter in repelling"
" the Atokpi, a civilization now extinct, albeit not without consequence."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Chosen_of_Marsh.cfg:25
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Swamp_Mage.cfg:24
