#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Swamp_Mage.cfg:74
msgid "damned flame"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Clan_Leader, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Clan_Leader.cfg:4
msgid "Clan Leader"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Clan_Leader, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Clan_Leader.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Adepts who excel in battle, usually through cunning implementation of their "
"water magicks, become the de-facto leaders of their clans, as signified by "
"the extra feathers in their headdresses. Their knowledge expands, allowing "
"them to enspell their claws to make them more powerful, to cast more baneful "
"ice-balls and better healing magic."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Corrupted_Shaman, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Corrupted_Shaman.cfg:4
msgid "Corrupted Shaman"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Corrupted_Shaman, race=lizard
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Corrupted_Shaman.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Some of the Dark Blood Shamans get corrupted. By who, or what, nobody knows, "
"but it makes them exchange their Water Magic for that of its polar opposite -"
" Fire. They lose their healing abilities, but they don’t seem to care, as "
"they say that Fire is inherently superior to Water.\n"
"Whatever corrupts them changes their personalities, too, making them selfish "
"and cruel. As a result, they are shunned from their tribes, which exile them "
"to the heart of the Great Bog. Forced to wander the Bog for years, they "
"usually make their way out and hire themselves to some of the morally "
"bankrupt tribes."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Desert_Salamander, race=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Desert_Salamander.cfg:4
msgid "Desert Salamander"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=DSRT_SAL_RES
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Desert_Salamander.cfg:20
msgid "+10% fire resistance, +5% cold resistance, Max HP bonus +2"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=DSRT_SAL_BLD
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Desert_Salamander.cfg:47
msgid "Bloodlust +5, Max HP bonus +2"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Desert_Salamander, race=AE_mag_salamander
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Desert_Salamander.cfg:72
msgid ""
"In search of relics and ancient ruins around the world one may encounter a "
"Desert Salamander. They are Yellow Salamanders that retired from their "
"warrior way of life to live a life of exploring the mysteries of the past. "
"Finding one away from the Great Desert is quite a surprise since as their "
"name and skin color implies they are desert rovers. It is true that most "
"Desert Salamanders roam the sandy dunes of the Great Desert exploring the "
"ruins hidden under the sands of time. However exploring is dangerous work for"
" one does not know what dangers dwell within the ruins, be it trap, monster "
"or competitor."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Desert_Salamander.cfg:142
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Dark_Blood_Alliance/Yellow_Salamander.cfg:87
msgid "kunai"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Dreadnought, race=lizard
