#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Atokpi_Infantry, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Atokpi_Infantry.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Before the fall of the Atokpi Empire the vast majority of Atokpis were Yari "
"users. Equipped with these unusual spear-like weapons, proud Atokpi warriors "
"formed unstoppable legions often deployed in the war against Darkblooded "
"thousands of years ago. The use of 4 arms combined with their exoskeleton "
"anatomy made Atokpis literally unbeatable when using these powerful polearm "
"weapons and almost lead to victory over the inhabitants of the Great Jungle. "
"Unfortunately, Atokpis' demise from the hands of Destroyers and subsequent "
"transformation into an undead swarm, severely limited their potential to "
"effectively wield these legendary weapons. The lack of muscles forced undead "
"Atokpis to use much smaller Yari weapons than their living counterparts used "
"to carry. The result was a more mobile but much less stronger version of a "
"living Atokpi warrior."
msgstr ""

