msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Black_Portal, race=AE_mag_magical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Black_Portal.cfg:4
msgid "Black Portal"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Black_Portal, race=AE_mag_magical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Black_Portal.cfg:19
msgid ""
"In most situations Dark Portals implode into Infernal Vortices, but sometimes"
" they absorb surrounding black magic instead, transforming themselves into a "
"mix of both anti-magic and black magic - Black Portals.\n"
"\n"
"This gives them new properties like much greater speed - fast enough to chase"
" very agile enemies - and the ability to use sparks of black magic to "
"directly attack selected targets.\n"
"\n"
"It is known that Black Portals can devour almost anything standing nearby "
"including living, magical, undead and mechanical beings. Consumed matter "
"helps these bizarre units stabilize their singularities allowing them to last"
" longer on battlefields."
msgstr ""

