#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Crimson_Atokpi, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Crimson_Atokpi.cfg:4
msgid "Crimson Atokpi"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Crimson_Atokpi, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Crimson_Atokpi.cfg:26
msgid ""
"It is said that elite troops of the Atokpi Empire were capable of carrying "
"legendary Doom Spears of astonishing length. Thanks to these powerful weapons"
" they were capable of killing any kind of armored foe with just one strike. "
"But sadly for Atokpi, their best warriors were not as effective as expected "
"against undead swarms. Destroyers tried to equip the doom spears but none of "
"their undead Atokpis were able to even carry one of these incredible weapons,"
" that is why they just equipped the shorter but more portable version of "
"Yari, typically used by novices. Crimson Atokpis, albeit smaller that their "
"samurai counterparts, are very agile and will try to find and assault weak "
"spots in enemy defense lines, allowing the undead swarm to destroy even the "
"most fortified targets from behind."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cyclops_Necromancer, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Cyclops_Necromancer.cfg:4
msgid "Cyclops Necromancer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cyclops_Necromancer, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Cyclops_Necromancer.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Destroyer 'necromancers' are not to be mistaken with lich of any kind, for "
"they do not possess any semblance of willpower of their past self, nor soul "
"or mind. These long dead masters of the undead support the destroyer dark "
"forces with an untold supply of corpses from past conquests... or maybe not "
"so old battles. The only certainty is death on their wake."
msgstr ""

