msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Dark_Apostle, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Dark_Apostle.cfg:24
msgid ""
"The Dark Apostles are the forerunners of extinction, the product of a million"
" souls inside the emptiness of an eternal Nightmare: so many that they can be"
" constantly heard from the outside of the void as a ceaseless whisper. A Dark"
" Apostle is formidable by itself, but the real danger is what they represent:"
" the dreadful force they are spearheading with their whispering."
msgstr ""

