#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Greater_Cyclops_Skeleton, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Greater_Cyclops_Skeleton.cfg:4
msgid "Greater Cyclops Skeleton"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Greater_Cyclops_Skeleton, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Greater_Cyclops_Skeleton.cfg:23
msgid ""
"In the time before time, the cyclopean Empire stood unchallenged, mighty and "
"eternal. Its mastery over the dark arts cannot be measured nor compared to "
"what today is known, many of its secrets lost to time... and the calamity "
"that caused its downfall. This undead minion is an echo of this distant past."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Harbinger, race=undead
#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_deep_Harbinger, race=AE_dep_deep_elf, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Harbinger.cfg:4
#: ./units/misc_units/deep-elves/Harbinger.cfg:5
msgid "Harbinger"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Harbinger, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Harbinger.cfg:23
msgid ""
"Sometimes, when a Nightmare consumes too many souls, they fail to stabilize "
"their original soul and implode into a being of pure void, fracturing reality"
" around itself into an anti-magic black hole. This cursed spirit is able to "
"destabilize its prey to more easily absorb its vital energy, but is no longer"
" interested in devouring the soul: it just erases it, feeding the corpse to "
"the growing hordes of the Destroyers."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Infernal_Vortex, race=AE_mag_magical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Infernal_Vortex.cfg:4
msgid "Infernal Vortex"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Infernal_Vortex, race=AE_mag_magical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Infernal_Vortex.cfg:19
msgid ""
"These occult masterpieces of anti-magic are pure manifestations of "
"destructive power. Nothing can withstand the ceaseless anti-magic emissions "
"of an Infernal Vortex. Whatever lies in its center, it surely must be "
"connected directly to hell. There is no other explanation..."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Mara, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Mara.cfg:4
msgid "Mara"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Mara, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Mara.cfg:23
msgid ""
"When a Nightmare has consumed enough souls, they may stabilize their chaotic "
"anti-magic energy flux and channel it into an echo of the being it used to "
"be: a Mara. A Mara is an abomination to the spirit realm, as it possesses no "
"will of its own, and is in constant terrible agony by just existing. This "
"tortured soul seeks vengeance on everything the destroyers see fit, making it"
" a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=fire, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Mara.cfg:40
msgid "touch of doom"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Moloch, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Moloch.cfg:4
msgid "Moloch"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Moloch, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Moloch.cfg:25
msgid ""
"In the destroyers' path of extinguishing any life, some races are bound to "
"not be fit for combat or casting: peaceful trading races and farming "
"societies that value peace above all have very little use as undead minions "
"unless they have an outstanding physique or mind.\n"
"Everything else is crushed, absorbed and condensed into the largest of the "
"destroyers' war machines, a titanic construct of death and desolation: the "
"Moloch.\n"
"This mindless rotten abomination carries the will of the destroyers to any "
"world they conquer, as a terrifying reminder to the weak that even they will "
"become strong when united."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Nightmare, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Nightmare.cfg:25
msgid ""
"Nightmares are ghostly animated remains, held together by anti-magic. Their "
"fiery touch can drain a creature's life force, as well as making them "
"hallucinate. Many speculate that the these things may very well have "
"originated from whatever is on the other side of the Dark Portals."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Obliterator, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Obliterator.cfg:4
msgid "Obliterator"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Omen, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Omen.cfg:4
msgid "Omen"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Omen, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Omen.cfg:25
msgid ""
"Omens are lesser manifestations of the Destroyers' will - chaotic creatures "
"made of mixed parts of the most powerful warriors consumed by Destroyers "
"thousands of years ago. They do not have legs - instead, they levitate above "
"ground, emerging from a red cloud, which is, by many, equated with pure hell."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Pirafly, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Pirafly.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Piraflies are remains of larvae of extinct flying fish whose adults have been"
" known for consuming large creatures like whales and elephants. Now undead "
"corpses of these species are under Destroyers' control."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Pirania_Monstruosa, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Destroyers/Pirania_Monstruosa.cfg:4
