#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Avenger, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Avenger.cfg:19
msgid ""
"The Avenger is a heavy tactical defense unit. His retaliation strikes are "
"always successful."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Bishop, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Bishop.cfg:4
msgid "female^Bishop"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Bishop, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Bishop.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Bishops are seasoned and highly respected priestesses of Light, setting "
"themselves apart through their proficiency in channeling the divine power of "
"the Light. Not only do their blessings rapidly restore their allies' wounds, "
"but they also significantly boost the morale of those around them. By drawing"
" upon their deep understanding of the intricacies of Light magic, these "
"esteemed individuals are able to imbue their spells with greater potency than"
" Clerics. As veteran members of the priesthood, they hold significant power "
"and influence within the Kharosian society."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Bronze_Warrior, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Bronze_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "Bronze Warrior"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Bronze_Warrior, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Bronze_Warrior.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Bronze warriors are former white warriors who are able to afford better "
"equipment, wielding a sword and a mace. They also wear full-plate bronze "
"armor, for which they got their name in the first place."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cavalry_Archer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Cavalry_Archer.cfg:4
msgid "Cavalry Archer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cavalry_Archer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Cavalry_Archer.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Cavalry Archers used to be a single independent tribe in the past. They come "
"from the Acacia Forest region which is now a part of the Kharos country. They"
" are mainly used as scouts or messengers, but they are also quite good for "
"flanking, or chasing down retreating enemies."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Child_of_Light, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Child_of_Light.cfg:4
msgid "female^Child of Light"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Child_of_Light.cfg:66
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Mistress_of_Light.cfg:80
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Sister_of_Light.cfg:56
#: ./units/ME_units/holy_order/h2-twilight.cfg:36
msgid "light touch"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Child_of_Light.cfg:78
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Mistress_of_Light.cfg:92
msgid "lightstorm"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cleric, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Cleric.cfg:18
msgid ""
"In the Kharosian society, it's common for women to join the priesthood. They "
"dedicate much of their time to studying light magic, which is far more widely"
" practiced by Kharosian women, while solar magic is more commonly used by the"
" Kharosian men. In peacetime they mainly perform religious duties and heal "
"the sick, while in wartime they conjure beams of light at their foes, and "
"heal wounded comrades. The more experienced clerics usually end up becoming "
"Bishops, but some may choose to take a much different path."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Divine_Executor, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Divine_Executor.cfg:4
msgid "Divine Executor"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Divine_Executor, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Divine_Executor.cfg:19
msgid ""
"The most elite Impalers often attain great importance in Kharos society, "
"earning the title of Divine Executors due to their exceptional rarity and "
"heroism. These soldiers have lived through numerous battles with little more "
"than their skill and determination to protect their people. As a result, they"
" are granted special sacred equipment inspired by historic legends that have "
"shaped Kharos' destiny and survival. While these tools may lack the same "
"level of magical resistance as those wielded by Sun Followers' cult members, "
"they offer distinct advantages such as increased maneuverability and the "
"ability to inflict huge amounts of damage to evil forces."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Elemental_Archer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Elemental_Archer.cfg:4
msgid "Elemental Archer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Elemental_Archer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Elemental_Archer.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Elite cavalry archers are often seen using enchanted arrows to gain the upper"
" hand in combat. The process of making these arrows remains a mystery, but "
"some speculate that the Sky Kingdom is involved in it."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fanatic, race=human
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mrc_fanatics_Fanatic, race=AE_mrc_fanatics_race, gender=male
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fanatic.cfg:4
#: ./units/ME_units/fanatics/e3-fanatic.cfg:5
msgid "Fanatic"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fanatic_killandrun
#. [advancement], id=red_ulf_killandrun
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fanatic.cfg:21
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Runemasters/Red_Steam_Ulfserker.cfg:85
msgid "Kill and Run 2, +3 HP, +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fanatic_melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fanatic.cfg:51
msgid "+1 strike on melee, +3 HP, +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fanatic_magicdodge
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fanatic.cfg:80
msgid "Magic Dodge on melee, +3 HP, +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fanatic, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fanatic.cfg:111
msgid ""
"Fanatics belong to a very unique cast of warriors in Kharos society. Equipped"
" with enchanted blades converting enemy pain into healing power. Once "
"deployed, they can outmatch even the strongest warriors."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fire_Priestess, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Priestess.cfg:4
msgid "female^Fire Priestess"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fire_Priestess, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Priestess.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Fire Priestess is a devout servant of the Order of Fire, a mystical sect "
"known for harnessing the raw power of flame to annihilate their enemies. The "
"order itself has existed for a long time, being founded during Kharos's "
"unification wars, but was few in number for most of its history. However, "
"that changed after the start of the Tharis invasion of Kharos.\n"
"\n"
"Many former Clerics began flocking to the order in droves seeking vengeance, "
"many of them having lost comrades or loved ones to the dark horde. Realizing "
"that the kindness of the Light is too soft to deal with the merciless threat,"
" they instead embrace the Sun's righteous fury. Rather than specializing in "
"healing their comrades like Bishops do, Fire Priestesses believe that the "
"best way to save lives is to vaporize an enemy before he is able to wound or "
"kill anyone.\n"
"\n"
"With a flick of her wrist, a Fire Priestess can summon waves of burning fury "
"to engulf her enemies, reducing them to ash and smoke. Her eyes burn bright "
"with holy fervor, her heart consumed by the fire of righteousness. For her, "
"there is no greater honor than defending her kin and faith with every breath,"
" every swing of her blade and every fireball launched at enemies of Kharos."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fire_Swordsman, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Swordsman.cfg:4
msgid "Fire Swordsman"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fireswordsman_solarregen
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Swordsman.cfg:19
msgid "Solar Regeneration 4/6, +3 HP +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fireswordsman_melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Swordsman.cfg:49
msgid "+2 melee damage, +3 HP, +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [advancement], id=fireswordsman_resistances
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Swordsman.cfg:78
msgid "+10% blade/pierce/impact/fire resistance, +3 HP +20% max XP"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fire_Swordsman, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Swordsman.cfg:111
msgid ""
"When a slicer survives enough battles he is given a fire sword as an addition"
" to his normal blades. Fire Swordsmen's swords are enchanted by Fire "
"Templars, using same magic that the latter use for their own blades."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Fire_Templar, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Fire_Templar.cfg:4
msgid "female^Fire Templar"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golden_Warrior, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Golden_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "Golden Warrior"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golden_Warrior, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Golden_Warrior.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Extremely fast, dangerous and powerful. The Golden warrior can focus the sun "
"rays, completely burning enemies."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=blade, range=melee
#. [attack], type=arcane, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Golden_Warrior.cfg:66
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Golden_Warrior.cfg:78
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Silver_Warrior.cfg:61
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Silver_Warrior.cfg:70
