msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Grand_Kharosian_Warbanner, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Grand_Kharosian_Warbanner.cfg:4
msgid "Grand Kharosian Warbanner"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Grand_Kharosian_Warbanner, race=human
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Kharos_War_Banner, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Grand_Kharosian_Warbanner.cfg:21
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Kharos_War_Banner.cfg:19
msgid ""
"It's common practice in the Kharosian military to use war banners to boost "
"the nearby troops' morale. The banner itself shows the Kharos nation's emblem"
" - the golden sun. It's protected by two people - a cleric, who shoots nearby"
" foes with beams of light, and a soldier who carries the banner. The cleric "
"also creates a protective aura on the banner, which decreases power of "
"destructive spells casted against it."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Heavy_Cavalry, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Heavy_Cavalry.cfg:4
msgid "Heavy Cavalry"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Heavy_Cavalry, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Heavy_Cavalry.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Those Cavalry Archers who don´t dabble with foreign magic armour their horses"
" with good and solid metal instead. They are still fearsome archers and their"
" horses are strong too, but theiy have given some mobility in exchange for "
"their heavier armour."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Hoplite, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Hoplite.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Hoplites are elite shielders, whose shields are large enough not only to "
"protect themselves, but also to cover their comrades."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Inspired, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Inspired.cfg:4
msgid "female^Inspired"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Inspired, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Inspired.cfg:21
msgid ""
"When a Sister of light grows older and sees more of the harsh world she may "
"not only be filled with more light, but also with courage and bravery. If "
"this is the case she learns the way of the sword from the Golden Warriors and"
" the way of the bow from the archers. While learning this way of the warrior "
"she is still able to wield the arcane magic of the light which she bound to "
"her arrows. Paired with her courage and bravery she inspire the younger and "
"more inexperienced soldiers of Kharos to fight ever harder for the light and "
"the sun."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Inspired.cfg:92
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Kharos/Mystical_Archer.cfg:90
