msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Aeromancer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Aeromancer.cfg:4
msgid "Aeromancer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Aeromancer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Aeromancer.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Air Magi are widely known for their extraordinary agility, but are rather "
"frail due to their lack of armor. However, they are capable of easily pushing"
" arrows and even spears slightly off course by gales created around "
"themselves, mitigating most pierce damage. Such magi are usually used as "
"scouts and messengers."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Aeromancer.cfg:80
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Air.cfg:93
msgid "wind gust"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Aeromancer.cfg:89
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Air.cfg:105
msgid "sparks"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Aeromancer.cfg:101
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Summoners/Air_Elemental.cfg:79
msgid "small lightning"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Architect, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Architect.cfg:4
msgid "Architect"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Battle_Eye, race=mechanical
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golden_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Battle_Eye.cfg:4
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golden_Mage.cfg:53
msgid "Battle Eye"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Battle_Eye, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Battle_Eye.cfg:16
msgid ""
"Battle Eyes are an upgraded version of the Magical Eyes, specifically "
"designed for combat, not just scouting. They have sharp, spinning steel rings"
" around their shell, which act both as a weapon, and a shield."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=blade, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Battle_Eye.cfg:45
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Cosmic_Eye.cfg:46
msgid "blade ring"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Battle_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Battle_Mage.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Battle Magi are the novice magic users with fairly good physical fitness. "
"These dagger-carrying troops form the backbone of the Sky Kingdom infantry, "
"alongside Hidden Faces. Given enough experience, such novices can either keep"
" advancing as versatile infantry troops, joining the ranks of War Magi, or "
"heavily devote themselves into advanced study of combat spells at the expense"
" of physical training, becoming Sorcerers."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Black_Mage, race=human
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mrc_mercenaries_Black_Mage, race=AE_mrc_mercenaries_race, gender=male
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Black_Mage.cfg:4
#: ./units/ME_units/mercenaries/e3-Blackmage.cfg:5
msgid "Black Mage"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Black_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Black_Mage.cfg:18
msgid ""
"While most nations persecute black magic, the Sky Kingdom doesn't seem mind "
"it, and even treats it equally to other forms of magic, due to their "
"ideology. While the practitioners of this kind of sorcery are uncommon in the"
" Sky Kingdom, they are certainly capable of feats comparable to those of the "
"Tharis warlocks. However, the years of dabbling in the dark arts have been "
"noticed to alter the mages' personality..."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chronomancer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Chronomancer.cfg:4
msgid "Chronomancer"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=cold, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Chronomancer.cfg:118
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Void_Mage.cfg:114
msgid "immobilization"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cosmic_Eye, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Cosmic_Eye.cfg:4
msgid "Cosmic Eye"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Cosmic_Eye, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Cosmic_Eye.cfg:16
msgid ""
"Cosmic Eyes are the most advanced version of the magical eye. They are used "
"for guarding the top secret laboratories of the Sky Kingdom, as well as "
"protecting crucial research sites."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=secret, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Cosmic_Eye.cfg:71
msgid "reality warp"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Elementalist, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Elementalist.cfg:17
msgid ""
"While Elementalists aren’t exactly great combatants compared to other Sky "
"Kingdom magi, they are quick learners, being able to become quite powerful "
"quite quickly by choosing to learn one of the Elemental Paths. They know a "
"few basic spells of each element, including shooting somewhat weak magical "
"missiles, healing minor wounds with water magic, as well as some non-combat "
"spells."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=ranged
#. [attack], type=cold, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Elementalist.cfg:60
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Hydromancer.cfg:73
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_Mage.cfg:54
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:108
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Water.cfg:72
msgid "icicles"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golden_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golden_Mage.cfg:4
msgid "Golden Mage"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golden_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golden_Mage.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Golden Magi are equally skilled with swords and magic. They wear beautiful "
"golden armor, after which they’re named, and use swords materializing in "
"their hands from thin air. They are known to emerge victorious from even the "
"harshest conflicts."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golden_Mage.cfg:49
msgid "Summon Battle Eye"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golem, race=mechanical
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Guru_of_Magic, race=human
#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Golem, race=mechanical
#. [unit_type], id=AE_rhy_mh_Earthgolem, race=mechanical
#. [unit_type], id=AE_feu_clockwork_dwarves_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golem.cfg:4
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:31
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Golem.cfg:4
#: ./units/RE_units/human-mountain/Golem-earth.cfg:4
#: ./units/feudal_units/mechanical-clockwork/Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Golem.cfg:15
msgid ""
"Golems are bulky magical constructs used by the Sky Kingdom. They are "
"produced in the same workshops as the Magical Eyes, but out of fairly mundane"
" materials, such as steel, stone, and sometimes ceramic. They usually serve "
"as guardians, but they can also be seen on the surface, acting as cannon "
"fodder for the magi. They don't have any weaponry, but their sheer weight "
"allows them to ram or crush their enemies with their stout bodies."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Guru_of_Magic, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:4
msgid "Guru of Magic"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Guru_of_Magic, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:21
msgid ""
"The title of Guru is only granted to the Sky Kingdom's brightest minds, whose"
" knowledge of the world's secrets is rivalled by few. They rarely engage in "
"combat, but they are known to be fairly eccentric when doing so, crushing "
"their foes with large chunks of rock summoned above their heads."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:25
msgid "Summon Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=secret, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:111
msgid "mystic touch"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=secret, range=ranged
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Guru_of_Magic.cfg:125
msgid "um strike"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Hidden_Face, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Hidden_Face.cfg:4
msgid "Hidden Face"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Hidden_Face, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Hidden_Face.cfg:24
msgid ""
"The Hidden Faces are a mysterious group of warriors, possessing extraordinary"
" agility, who form the backbone of the Sky Kingdom's armies. Little is known "
"about them, but some speculate that this group might be from a nomadic nation"
" that is allied with the Sky Kingdom."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Hydromancer, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Hydromancer.cfg:39
msgid ""
"Unlike their Fire colleagues, the Water Magi are known to be fairly peaceful,"
" using their power to heal, not to destroy. They act as doctors, or field "
"medics, depending on what the situation calls for. They lack the offensive "
"power the Fire Magi possess, but they're are able to use their water magic on"
" the enemies’ bodies to slow them, or pelt them with sharp shards of ice "
"conjured out of thin air."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Hydromancer.cfg:61
msgid "water blast"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Magical_Eye, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Magical_Eye.cfg:4
msgid "Magical Eye"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Magical_Eye, race=mechanical
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Magical_Eye.cfg:16
msgid ""
"Magical Eyes are a breed of flying constructs made out of magical energy "
"contained inside metal shells via magnetic force. They can make microscopic "
"gaps in the shell to release concentrated beams of such energy at their "
"opponents. They are manufactured in special workshops scattered throughout "
"the kingdom. Their shells are made out of an unusual metal, which is slightly"
" lighter than even the air itself, but is rather fragile. They are "
"occasionally known to be used like carrier pigeons, delivering messages and "
"small objects when Air Magi are unavailable."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Master_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_Mage.cfg:4
msgid "Master Mage"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Master_Mage, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_Mage.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Though not as skilled with each element as the Elemental Masters, Master Magi"
" have decent knowledge of most kinds of magic, giving them a lot of options "
"in terms of spellcasting. When attacked, Master Magi create an energy shield "
"around themselves, which absorbs some of the incoming damage."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_Mage.cfg:42
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:96
msgid "magic touch"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Master_of_Air, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Air.cfg:4
msgid "Master of Air"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Master_of_Air, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Air.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Masters of Air are renowned for their mobility and control over electricity. "
"Many of them work as cartographers, recording the layout of even the most "
"remote locations. They are also capable of animating particles of air, "
"shaping them into air elementals."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Air.cfg:27
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:71
