#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:4
msgid "Master of Elements"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Master_of_Elements, race=human
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:20
msgid ""
"It's generally believed that one person can't truly master more than a single"
" form of magic. However, there have been rare exceptions to the rule, "
"extraordinary individuals who managed to become nearly as skilled with using "
"each element as that element's elemental masters, at once. They are very "
"respected by their peers, and granted a seat at the Council of Masters. "
"Though such magi rarely leave the Sky Kingdom, on the battlefield, their "
"versatile elemental magic can easily obliterate most kinds of foes."
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Elements.cfg:69
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Sky_Kingdom/Master_of_Fire.cfg:23
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Summoners/Grand_Summoner.cfg:64
