msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Sword_Dancer, race=AE_mag_tharis
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Tharis/Sword_Dancer.cfg:153
msgid ""
"The sword dancer is a formidable warrior known for their lightning-fast "
"movements and deadly precision. While their primary weapon of choice may be "
"shortswords, they are just as skilled with their trusty chakrams in ranged "
"combat. These unique fighters have honed their skills through years of "
"practice and training, and their bodies are attuned to the rhythm of battle. "
"Before each fight, they indulge in a ritual involving psychedelic substances,"
" heightening their senses and allowing them to move with superhuman speed and"
" agility. With their enhanced reflexes and keen instincts, they can "
"effortlessly dodge enemy attacks and strike back with deadly accuracy. But "
"their prowess doesn't stop there - these warriors also possess some "
"regenerative abilities similar to those of Great Warlocks, allowing them to "
"heal themselves during battle and stay in the fight longer. The end result is"
" a fearsome opponent who can outmaneuver even the most skilled foes."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Witch, race=AE_mag_tharis, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Tharis/Witch.cfg:4
msgid "Witch"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Witch, race=AE_mag_tharis, gender=female
#: ./units/EoMa_units/Tharis/Witch.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Tharis witches are powerful female acolytes of the dark cult of Tharis, "
"tasked with unleashing devastating attacks upon their enemies. These "
"practitioners of the arcane arts perform a sacred blood ritual, imbuing "
"themselves with supernatural energies that allow them to unleash torrents of "
"tiny, otherworldly flames upon their foes. This draining of life force not "
"only weakens but also heals the witch in direct proportion to the suffering "
"she inflicts upon her opponents. In contrast to the unarmed Disciples, who "
"rely solely on their magical abilities, witches wield curved spears with "
"deadly precision, showcasing their skill and versatility as warriors of "
"darkness."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mag_Chaotic_Observer, race=undead
#: ./units/EoMa_units/unused/Chaotic_Observer.cfg:4
msgid "Chaotic Observer"
msgstr ""

