msgid ""
"People who learns the arts of illusion their bodies change which is "
"considered a price to pay to inmerse correctly in this type of magic. While "
"illusion magic is seen as a treat or scary to some Altaris people, they "
"understand the practical uses of the nearly costless cannon fodders Illusions"
" which helps Altaris at having less real living casualties. So Altaris don't "
"stop anyone to learn darker arts as Ilusion magic which is an odd exception "
"they tolerate."
msgstr ""

