msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Crystal_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Crystal_Golem.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Crystal Golems are extremely heavy and nothing flexible, making them the most"
" clumsy of all golems. They're very traslucid which makes them nearly immune "
"to magic of light and bear extremely well cold temperatures. While somewhat "
"hard to piercing and cutting attacks, impact is very effective againist them "
"and not likely to dodge many hits very often.\n"
"\t\n"
"\tThey fire crystal shards at long distances which makes them deadly at both "
"close and long range."
msgstr ""

