msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Golden_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Golden_Golem.cfg:19
msgid ""
"It's known that gold is an expensive, heavy and exotic metal, seems that "
"golems made of this material do not have the best fighting properties, still "
"Altirians sometimes use them as they can transform into gold what golem gets "
"killed."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Golem.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Basic golems are made of a combination of clay, cement and few other "
"additions. Altirians can mold them into more advanced golems with different "
"properties."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Conjurer_illusion, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusion_Conjurer.cfg:4
msgid "Conjurer (Illusion)"
