#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusion_Illusionist.cfg:4
msgid "Illusionist (Illusion)"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Master_of_Illusion_illusion, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusion_Master_of_Illusion.cfg:4
msgid "Master of Illusion (Illusion)"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Illusionist, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusionist.cfg:4
msgid "Illusionist"
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusionist.cfg:9
msgid "Replicate unit (8 Gold)"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Illusionist, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Illusionist.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Illusionists after gaining more experience can use more correctly their "
"magically altered bodies and also to summon more deadly illusions. They in "
"soon can revert their transformation in their bodies but they still find "
"akward their bodies before change... specially in fights..."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Iron_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Iron_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Iron Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Iron_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Iron_Golem.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Golems made of Iron are heavy but very resistant to physical attacks, still "
"againist magic they do not oustand."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Land_Mage, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Land_Mage.cfg:4
msgid "Land Mage"
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Land_Mage.cfg:10
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Lord_of_Earth.cfg:10
msgid "Create a Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Land_Mage, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Land_Mage.cfg:42
msgid ""
"Lands Mages were learning from some of the living legends that survived the "
"overwhelm that slain most Altaris people, their skills not only at combat but"
" also in other aspects are important parts of all remaining Altaris. "
"Privileges that were common only in Lords of Earth caste (like having golem "
"bodyguards or servants, many other things) is now part of the daily life of "
"all remaining Altaris since surviving that castratophic war."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#. [attack], type=impact, range=ranged
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Land_Mage.cfg:59
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Land_Mage.cfg:71
msgid "crushing fist"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Incursionist, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Incursionist.cfg:6
msgid "Incursionist"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Incursionist, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Incursionist.cfg:20
msgid ""
"While light scouts often do high risk infiltration over blood elf camp, some "
"manage to survive and profecialize in their job. Incusionist are trained to "
"go deeper in blood elf camps and have joned an Altaris botherhood and often "
"are asked to send messages between different altaris towns."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Interceptor, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Interceptor.cfg:6
msgid "Interceptor"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Interceptor, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Interceptor.cfg:20
msgid ""
"While light scouts often do high risk infiltration over blood elf camp, some "
"manage to survive and profecialize in their job. Interceptor specializes at "
"taking away fleeding enemies and in being expert in close space maneuvers."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Scout, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Scout.cfg:5
msgid "Light Scout"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Light_Scout, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Light_Scout.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Light Scouts are prepared to infiltrate to blood elves lands and warn Altaris"
" about an upcoming war at time. Their robes are extremely ressistant to heat "
"which also helps a lot againist blood elves.\n"
"\t\n"
"Sadly, rarely they live too long in their heroic task. Usually because of "
"their high risk task they're not blessed by the ancients because that ritual "
"takes a lot of time."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Lord_of_Earth, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Lord_of_Earth.cfg:4
msgid "Lord of Earth"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Lord_of_Earth, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Lord_of_Earth.cfg:34
msgid ""
"In better times Lords of Earth were a pacific caste of wealthy people, but "
"when they were advised about an inminent invasion of an unknown enemy, they "
"learnt in record time how to use their spells for the upcoming war. Their "
"superior toughtness, the location where they fought for their homeland and "
"their golem servants were all determinant factors that allowed them to "
"survive what have slain over 80% of Altaris people and become legends over "
"generations."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Mage_of_Earth, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Mage_of_Earth.cfg:4
msgid "Mage of Earth"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Mage_of_Earth, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Mage_of_Earth.cfg:28
msgid ""
"In greater times Altaris was a prospere civilization with mages of all kinds,"
" but in an invasion of an unknown enemy almost all Altaris people been slain "
"to keep their sacred ancient's secrets. While Altaris won the war, the price "
"was almsot their entire civilization... surviving only the legendary best "
"masters of earth mages and the Ancient Keepers with the precious ancient's "
"secrets. Even after the overwhelm, surviving Altaris are procient in earth "
"magic and their multiple uses like animating golems of many materials and a "
"mysterous method to craft armors out of melting stones. "
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Master_at_Arms, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Master_at_Arms.cfg:4
msgid "Master at Arms"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Master_at_Arms, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Master_at_Arms.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Some botherhood veterans decide to not break the special bond, allowing them "
"being very versatile warriors specially with their botherhood."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Master_of_Illusion, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Master_of_Illusion.cfg:4
msgid "Master of Illusion"
msgstr ""

#. [abilities]
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Master_of_Illusion.cfg:10
msgid "Replicate unit (13 Gold)"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Master_of_Illusion, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Master_of_Illusion.cfg:32
msgid ""
"Masters of Illusions are valuable in Altaris army as they're the only ones "
"that are allowed to teach Illusion magic to initiates as they're trusted "
"enough to perserve this not so ortodox entrepreneurship form of magic at "
"proving it doesn't alter the conscience nor giving weird alter-egos that "
"Altaris would not pardon to any kind of practice."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Mithril_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Mithril_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Mithril Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Mithril_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Mithril_Golem.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Mithril is a very mysterous ore with very interesting properties. It's highly"
" ressistant to magic but it suffers when it's all about absorbing physical "
"damages at being heavy and not as hard as other minerals."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Pegasus_Master, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Pegasus_Master.cfg:4
msgid "Pegasus Master"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Pegasus_Master, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Pegasus_Master.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Most skilled Pegasus riders weld divine lances that can still deal "
"devastating damage to the non living at dealing arcane damage. The lances are"
" not trust to amateur pegasus riders as these lances are not easy to craft."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Pegasus_Rider, race=Altaris
#. [unit_type], id=AE_mrc_equestrians_Pegasus_Rider, race=AE_mrc_equestrians_race, gender=male
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Pegasus_Rider.cfg:4
#: ./units/ME_units/equestrians/e1-pegasusrider.cfg:5
msgid "Pegasus Rider"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Pegasus_Rider, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Pegasus_Rider.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Somehow Altaris prevented pegasus from extinction in their homeland so they "
"can pet and ride them in battles. Pegasus Riders have an important role in "
"Altaris Army. Their main purpose is scouting from the skies and striking down"
" retreating enemies."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Primeval_Master, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Primeval_Master.cfg:4
msgid "Primeval Master"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Primeval_Master, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Primeval_Master.cfg:23
msgid ""
"Warriors that have learnt well the ancient guards are granted with the tittle"
" of Primeval Master even if they still not at the form of the ancient "
"warriors body trascedance."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Primeval_Warrior, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Primeval_Warrior.cfg:4
msgid "Primeval Warrior"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Primeval_Warrior, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Primeval_Warrior.cfg:22
msgid ""
"More advanced chosen can also heal alies from poison, and are closer to "
"become ancient warrior, still they have a long road to cover before "
"unleashing their truth inner power."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Quicksand_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Quicksand_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Quicksand Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Quicksand_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Quicksand_Golem.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Quicksand golems have somewhat good mobility and are capable to regenerate "
"the most fast. They only have to take care about magic attacks as they're not"
" stable againist magic."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=ranged
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Quicksand_Golem.cfg:35
msgid "mud"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Stone_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Stone_Golem.cfg:4
msgid "Stone Golem"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Stone_Golem, race=mechanical
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Stone_Golem.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Stone golems are the most equilibrated of all golems, while not being that "
"heavy like these golems made of heavier materials gives them some advantages "
"like better mobility.\n"
"\t\n"
"As they're made of floating rocks, they're not as solid as some other golems,"
" but this allow them to be deadly at both close and long range because they "
"can throw stones to its foes."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Stone_Warrior, race=Altaris
#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_despair_Stone_Warrior, race=AE_arc_race_despair
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Stone_Warrior.cfg:4
#: ./units/archaic_units/despair/Stone_Armor.cfg:4
msgid "Stone Warrior"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Stone_Warrior, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Stone_Warrior.cfg:25
msgid ""
"Altaris people are capable to craft liquid of stones, once drying process "
"ends ressult is equipment that is harder than most metals and also good at "
"absorving magic protecting the wearer. Only maces are made with this ancester"
" method because while being very strong swords, it's not possible to sharp "
"them to become a cutting weapon and maces made of this material are weight "
"but still cheaper to craft than swords ... because required strength or hard "
"material to sharp such swords is not possible at the momment."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Sword_Brother, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Sword_Brother.cfg:4
msgid "Sword Brother"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Sword_Brother, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Sword_Brother.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Some Altaris warriors have a special bond between themselves, their union is "
"their main strength."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Truehearted, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Truehearted.cfg:4
msgid "Truehearted"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_altaris_Truehearted, race=Altaris
#: ./units/FL_units/altaris/Truehearted.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Best ancient warriors are named truehearted and these are admired by all "
"Altiran people, fighting with them is described as a peaceful experience that"
" fills you in determination and hope. Wounds are magically regenerated if "
"being near of a truehearted for a long period of time."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Amazon, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Amazon.cfg:18
msgid ""
"Amazons are fierce warrios that are specialized in piercing weapons and how "
"to minimize the damage taken by piercing objects. Their bravery and boldness "
"inspire lower rank amazons to fight better."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Black_Harpy, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Black_Harpy.cfg:5
msgid "Black Harpy"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Black_Harpy, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Black_Harpy.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Black Harpies (or adult dark harpies) were the terror of Amazons before their"
" alliance, while dark harpies were being murdering in masses not the same "
"could be said about adult Black Harpies that were slaugtering amazins with "
"relatively low difficulty and enough to avoid dark harpies from extinction."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Bow_Mistress, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Bow_Mistress.cfg:5
msgid "Bow Mistress"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Bow_Mistress, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Bow_Mistress.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Once in the peak of their carer best Amazon archers are named Bow Mistress "
"and can strike with deadly accuracy even at very long distances. While some "
"foes argues that Bow Mistresses have better accuracy than best elvish archers"
" still they do not fire as fast and as strong but still proving that with "
"very hard training you can at least defeat elvish archers in one specific "
"characteristic even when welding a bow."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Bowwoman, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Bowwoman.cfg:5
msgid "Bowwoman"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Bowwoman, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Bowwoman.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Bowwomen are the main component of Amazon army, since childhood they been "
"training with the bow for both hunting and times of war so they become "
"excepctional archers even when young."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Commanderess, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Commanderess.cfg:4
msgid "Commanderess"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Commanderess, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Commanderess.cfg:22
msgid ""
"Comamanderess are the maximun autority in Amazon community, whatever she "
"orders it must be done as soon as possible. Her sisters love fighting with "
"her."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Creeper, race=monster
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Creeper.cfg:4
msgid "Creeper"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Creeper, race=monster
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Creeper.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Creeper is a strange plant that can jump and climb at larger trees, while "
"usually feeding from corpses they still can hunt and make their corpses if "
"trully in hunger. Somehow Amazons managed to tame this weird plants."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Cutthroat, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Cutthroat.cfg:21
msgid "Cuttorats are agile and deadly, still she's poorly armored."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Dark_Harpy, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Dark_Harpy.cfg:5
msgid "Dark Harpy"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Dark_Harpy, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Dark_Harpy.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Once the war between harpies and amazon, the dark harpy population started to"
" grow because they used to be the most common casualties in that war. Unlike "
"the glider specie, dark harpies are more nocturnal and hunts in night times "
"only."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Dryad, race=driada, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Dryad.cfg:22
msgid ""
"These young blond women are not human but are in excelent relations with "
"Amazons that tends to trully care about envoiroment having both the "
"acceptance and the support of Dryads."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Forest_Dryad, race=driada, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Forest_Dryad.cfg:4
msgid "Forest Dryad"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Forest_Dryad, race=driada, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Forest_Dryad.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Deeper in Amazon Forests, stronger dryads are protecting the forest from "
"intruders and advising amazons about their pressence as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Forest_Ghost, race=driada, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Forest_Ghost.cfg:4
msgid "Forest Ghost"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Forest_Ghost, race=driada, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Forest_Ghost.cfg:23
msgid ""
"Older dryads are for some reason named Forest Ghost, mostly because they can "
"float."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Giant_Creeper, race=monster
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Giant_Creeper.cfg:4
msgid "Giant Creeper"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Giant_Creeper, race=monster
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Giant_Creeper.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Once really feed, Giant creepers can become really huge... and their poison "
"now has some minor paralyzing properties for short time, which sometimes is "
"enough for the creeper to sucess in its hunting."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Great_Murderess, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Great_Murderess.cfg:4
msgid "Great Murderess"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Great_Murderess, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Great_Murderess.cfg:25
msgid ""
"Great Murderess specializes at chasing prays that tries to escape, animal and"
" human alike. Not particularly strong againist strong foes but she often do "
"not fight alone."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Guardswoman, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Guardswoman.cfg:4
msgid "Guardswoman"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Guardswoman, race=amazon, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Guardswoman.cfg:29
msgid ""
"Some amazons uses heavier equipment and focuses in keeping alive their "
"companions. While not very strong offensively she's tough."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Harpy, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Harpy.cfg:21
msgid ""
"After hunreds of years of conflict between harpies and Amazons seems that "
"they are now allied. It's said long ago a mysterous and very dangerous enemy "
"that was also a danger for even Altaris and Blood Elves, was the reason why "
"harpies and Amazons temporally allied... still they considered a full time "
"alliance."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Harpy_Glider, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Harpy_Glider.cfg:5
msgid "Harpy Glider"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_FL_amazon_Harpy_Glider, race=harpie, gender=female
#: ./units/FL_units/amazon/Harpy_Glider.cfg:25
