"an arcane attack instead of a cold one as it's usually more effecitve "
"againist most sea-creatures. This allows them to weaken the sea monters and "
"to capture them when very weakened ... and doing some kind of charm to these "
"monsters to make them join Pirates in their upcoming battles. Monsters seem "
"to have an affinity to fight next to the tamers who captured them or to "
"someone who smells very similar."
