"stories about that pirates have tamed these thunder serpents in battle, then "
"people will inmediatly joke at you, so if you show them your lightning scars "
"then will belive that you got hit by a lightning in a raining day, lightning "
"that became you crazy for telling such fantasy stories. So only people who "
"have seen this miracle by themselves knows these tales are truth and not "
"inventions of crazy men ... and usually most avoiding to tell their "
"experience in order to avoid social humilliations in bars. "
msgstr ""

