msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_mrc_holy_order_Eye_of_Fate, race=AE_mrc_holy_order_race, gender=male
#: ./units/ME_units/holy_order/e3-eyeoffate.cfg:20
msgid ""
"The Eyes of Fate are an elite few Listeners with extraordinary talents of "
"catching information. They are recruited by the Pope and are used to find any"
" dissent in the realm. When found, officers are sent out to stomp it into "
"submission, fate leading their cause."
msgstr ""

