#: ./units/ME_units/holy_order/f3-order.cfg:20
msgid ""
"When a Justice reaches the pinnacle of his or her career, they have one of 3 "
"choices. Orders are the ones who walk the middle. They are not as passionate "
"about upholding the laws as the Laws, and they do not feel as great a need to"
" protect the people as Peacekeepers do."
msgstr ""

