msgid ""
"When a Scholar has devoted most of his life to learning as much as he can, he"
" is eventually entrusted with the job of upkeeping the Library Arcana. "
"Because of all of the knowledge they have taken from the books they have "
"skimmed through, and the fact they are the last hope for any books that are "
"disposed of by those who find them to be corrupting, they are known as wisdom"
