#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_menagerie_Tower_Ladyboy, race=human, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/menagerie/Tower_Ladyboy.cfg:19
msgid ""
"It's not clear if these androgynous, sybarite slaves are really human - in an"
" unfortunate form of servitude, or are mere avatars designed by a hostile "
"force who mocks the established human power structure. Either way, their "
"hostility is not in question, and there is no reasoning with them."
msgstr ""

