msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_phantom_Wing_Dancer, race=AE_arc_race_phantom_egypt, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/phantom/Tomb_Wing.cfg:4
msgid "Wing Dancer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_phantom_Wing_Dancer, race=AE_arc_race_phantom_egypt, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/phantom/Tomb_Wing.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Higher priestesses of the strange sword-dance are fearsome warriors, but they"
" still have the same ability to feignt and distract the opponent so that they"
" can slip through gaps in enemy formations."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Aerowheel, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Aerowheel.cfg:4
msgid "Aerowheel"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Aerowheel, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Aerowheel.cfg:38
msgid ""
"Having mastered the cutting wheel, a Primeval Ironwheel must make a choice "
"whether to focus on the disc weapon or to tend to other skills required of a "
"high ranking soldier. Primeval Aerowheels have chosen the latter and are "
"mixed fighters, and somehow they can predict magical attacks dodging them "
"more often.\n"
"Special Note:"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Cutter, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Cutter.cfg:4
msgid "Cutter"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Cutter, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Cutter.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Primeval Cutters are not particularly strong, but they can launch cutting "
"metal discs. Cutters are able to provide a counter to enemy archers.\n"
"Special Note:"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Dogface, race=AE_arc_race_primeval
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Dogface.cfg:4
msgid "Dogface"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Dogface, race=AE_arc_race_primeval
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Dogface.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Like the experienced chakram throwers, the Primeval soldiers wear some sort "
"of visor. Though it simply looks like a piece of metal strapped across the "
"eyes, the visor appears to assist the fighter in targeting the enemy."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Driver, race=AE_arc_race_primeval
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Driver.cfg:4
msgid "Driver"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Driver, race=AE_arc_race_primeval
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Driver.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Primeval Drivers are not that much smaller than a Troll. They have risen out "
"of the Slowfoot ranks through strength and experience. With enough luck and "
"determination, they might be able to escape their caste and join the ranks of"
" the Line Breakers."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Firewheel, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Firewheel.cfg:4
msgid "Firewheel"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_primeval_Firewheel, race=AE_arc_race_primeval, gender=female
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Firewheel.cfg:38
msgid ""
"Having mastered the cutting wheel, a Primeval Ironwheel must make a choice "
"whether to focus on the disc weapon or to tend to other skills required of a "
"high ranking soldier. Primeval Fire have chosen the first and are ranged "
"specialists at refusing all physical armor and throwing at fores cutting or "
"burning chakrams. They are also known to be very resilient to cold and heat "
"but it is unknown from where this come from.\n"
"Special Note:"
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=fire, range=ranged
#: ./units/archaic_units/primeval/Primeval_Firewheel.cfg:63
msgid "firewheel"
msgstr ""

