msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Diver, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Divers.cfg:4
msgid "Diver"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Diver, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Divers.cfg:39
msgid ""
"Divers are oftenly employed to scare away sharks in ports. A throw of their "
"harpoon usually is enough to scare away a shark. Also in war, harpoon can be "
"used as a disabling weapon if aimed in the right spot."
msgstr ""

#. [female]
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Divers.cfg:155
msgid "female^Diver"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Greater_Albatross, race=gryphon, gender=male
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Greater-Albatross.cfg:4
msgid "Greater Albatross"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Marine, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Marines.cfg:4
msgid "Marine"
msgstr ""

#. [female]
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Marines.cfg:156
msgid "female^Marine"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Sea_Rover, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Rover.cfg:4
msgid "Sea Rover"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Sea_Rover, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Rover.cfg:19
msgid ""
"Some of the southern city-states earn their wealth through plunder and "
"exploitation. The roving pirates are not the strongest fighters, but they are"
" verstile enough to give trouble to almost any foe."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Salvager, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Salvager.cfg:4
msgid "Salvager"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_arc_south_seas_Salvager, race=AE_arc_race_south_seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Salvager.cfg:20
msgid ""
"The Salvagers are less concerned with the loading and unloading of ships, and"
" focus their efforts on the more lucrative job of salvage. They break apart "
"old ships and sell what can be sold. Long lances are useful in prodding "
"floating wood, as well as poking hostile forces."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Salvager.cfg:42
#: ./units/archaic_units/south-seas/Shoreman.cfg:40
