#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Bowman.cfg:18
msgid ""
"The use of archery in shooting something other than game was seen from its "
"inception, and archers have been indispensable in warfare since time "
"immemorial. Usually of humble origins, hailing from the peasantry or "
"woodsmen, bowmen are competent with both a bow and a short sword, and are "
"very common on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Cavalier, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Cavalier.cfg:18
msgid ""
"The Dark Cavaliers have reached the acme of skill with sword and lance. "
"Wearing full plate, and riding steeds bred more for power than for speed, "
"these warriors form the core of any serious cavalry force. A grand knight at "
"the head of a charge is a terrifying sight for infantry, and is often enough "
"to break right through a defensive line."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Champion, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Champion.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Some Legion Swordsman are granted the rank of Champion for their unsurpassed "
"skill with the longsword."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Crossbowman, race=human, gender=male
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Crossbowman.cfg:18
msgid "Some Bowman take the crossbow to battle for more focus on their melee."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Crusher, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Crusher.cfg:16
msgid "Not every Trooper chooses to don heavier armor and take up a defensive role."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Crusher.cfg:27
msgid "sledgehammer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Deathmaster, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Deathmaster.cfg:4
msgid "Deathmaster"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Deathmaster, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Deathmaster.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Some Halberdiers of the Legion have received the rank of Deathmaster for "
"their merciless killing on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Elite_Gunner, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Elite_Gunner.cfg:4
msgid "Elite Gunner"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Elite_Gunner, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Elite_Gunner.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Elite Gunners are the most feared soldiers on the Legion for their "
"thundersticks can blast a hole through any sort of armor."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Fighter, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Fighter.cfg:26
msgid "Some Legion soldiers decide to lead their troops into battle."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Guardian, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Guardian.cfg:15
msgid ""
"Guardians of the Legion are the defensive troopers and the sight of these "
"warriors make foes tremble with fear."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=impact, range=melee
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Guardian.cfg:25
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Terror.cfg:26
msgid "war hammer"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Gunner, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Gunner.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Some Legion spearman see best to use a thunderstick instead of a javelin. "
"These gunners are trained to blast their foes to smithereens."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Halberdier, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Halberdier.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Some Legion spearman decide to leave their spears and javelins behind take up"
" a halberd."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Heavy_Longbowman, race=human, gender=male
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Heavy_Longbowman.cfg:4
msgid "Heavy Longbowman"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Knight, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Knight.cfg:17
msgid ""
"The more skillful, and brave, of the Dark Raiders are promoted to Knights. "
"Veterans of combat, they are eager for more daring tactics and have learned "
"the art of the lance to charge directly into the enemy lines. They still "
"carry swords, however, for when less risky fighting is required."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Longswordsman, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Longswordsman.cfg:16
msgid ""
"Soldiers of the Legion are given a longer sword for improving their skill in "
"battle."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Pillager, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Pillager.cfg:18
msgid "Many a foe has been slain by the swift might of the Dark Pillagers."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Raider, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Raider.cfg:17
msgid ""
"Despite their love for infantry, even the Dark Legion cannot deny the "
"tactical advantage gained by mounted forces. The raiders often go ahead of "
"the rest of the Legion, harbingers of the death to come, or chase after a "
"retreating foe."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Soldier, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Soldier.cfg:16
msgid ""
"As Soldiers of the Legion, these men are armed with a sword and shield for "
"basic combat."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Spearman, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Spearman.cfg:16
msgid ""
"Swords are, for many, an expensive luxury, and one which peasants can ill "
"afford. Spears are much easier to make and will do well even without a "
"spearhead, though most can afford one. Clad in leather armor, and often armed"
" with a shield and a few javelins, spearmen are the staple of most armies, "
"often thrown into the front lines with only the most basic training."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Terror, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Terror.cfg:4
msgid "Terror"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Terror, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Terror.cfg:16
msgid "The sight of these Terrors mean the sign of retreating to any foe."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Trooper, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Trooper.cfg:4
msgid "Trooper"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Trooper, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Trooper.cfg:15
msgid ""
"As a Trooper of the Legion, this soldier's only purpose is to defend the "
"castles or vanguards."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_dark_legion_Warrior, race=human
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Warrior.cfg:27
msgid "Dark Warriors are the most feared leaders of the Legion."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=blade, range=ranged
#: ./units/misc_units/dark_legion/Dark_Warrior.cfg:48
msgid "razor chakram"
msgstr ""

