#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/choriote.cfg:20
msgid ""
"This unit is from the Steelhive faction. Its coding and art were done by "
"Zerovirus and melinath (modified slightly by Trans).\n"
" \n"
"The Choriote has gained stronger defenses- 50% defense on all terrain. \n"
"She now can learn, leech energy from enemies while healing surrounding "
"allies."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=fire, range=ranged
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/choriote.cfg:70
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/cybercore.cfg:50
