"The Lightshifters are excellent reflectors of heat and cold, making them "
"highly resistant to magical and energy attacks. Be wary!\n"
"But are somewhat highly vulnerable to physical attacks, especially to impact "
"type."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=arcane, range=ranged
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/lightshifter.cfg:46
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/mirage.cfg:53
msgid "light ray"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_steelhive_Mirage, race=AE_agl_steelhive, gender=female
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/mirage.cfg:7
msgid "Steel Mirage"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_steelhive_Mirage, race=AE_agl_steelhive, gender=female
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/mirage.cfg:16
msgid ""
"The Mirages are excellent reflectors of heat and cold, making them highly "
"resistant to magical and energy attacks. Be wary!\n"
"Unlike lightshifters, mirages are capable of ZoC which is a enormous tactical"
" advantage compared to the previously mentioned lightshifters.\n"
"\n"
"But are somewhat highly vulnerable to physical attacks, especially to impact "
"type.\n"
"With improved light ray, it can do extra harm the more times it hits the same"
" objective and now is more accurate against nimble targets.\n"
"\n"
"This unit counts with an exotic and unique feature of 20% ressistance to "
"secret, which is highest base value in all Ageless"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=AE_agl_steelhive_Nymph, race=AE_agl_steelhive, gender=female
