"orbiting blades around in a devastating combo strike. They are multi-purpose "
"units and are able to fly over water whereas their landlocked brethren cannot"
" for fear of shortcircuiting."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=blade, range=melee
#: ./units/misc_units/steelhive/oculus.cfg:29
