msgid ""
"Depending in circunstances like Spriggans are resident of a lugubrious, "
"cursed or melancholic places, some becomes inbued in bad vibes and start "
"becoming poisonous. Unlike Spriggans that are keepers of the nature and have "
"connection with spirits, Mandragoras instead become passively hostile, "
"lurking intruders that are unfortunate to be considered its pray. While "
"Mandragora are still loyal to what they used to consider their friends, still"
" they're friends of no-one anymore because of their selfish behavior and "
"because of being incable to incorporate to the yokai ecosystem, even if still"
" being considered part of it by both foreign and yokai."
